{"id":159,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Once Croconaw has clamped its jaws on its foe, it will absolutely not let go. Because the tips of its fangs are forked back like barbed fishhooks, they become impossible to remove when they have sunk in."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Once it bites down, it won’t let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place."},{"games":["X","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"If it loses a fang, a new one grows back in its place. There are always 48 fangs lining its mouth."},{"games":["SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"It opens its huge jaws wide when attacking. If it loses any fangs while biting, they grow back in."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Once its jaws clamp down on its foe, it will absolutely not let go. Because the tips of its fangs are forked back like fishhooks, they become irremovably embedded."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"The tips of its fangs are slanted backward. Once those fangs clamp down, the prey has no hope of escape."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Torrent","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Water-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Sheer Force","hidden":true,"description":"Removes any additional effects from the Pokémon's moves, but increases the moves' power."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Water 1"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"water's edge","color":"Blue","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":158,"name":"Totodile","condition":null,"children":[{"id":159,"name":"Croconaw","condition":"Lv. 18","children":[{"id":160,"name":"Feraligatr","condition":"Lv. 30","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,10],[1,43],[1,55],[13,44],[15,184],[21,423],[24,175],[30,242],[34,163],[37,103],[42,37],[47,401],[50,276],[55,56]],"machine":[332,59,784,280,886,242,174,91,38,337,349,283,203,263,313,374,812,264,56,58,423,8,196,710,67,232,189,330,182,706,240,156,46,157,317,184,421,214,180,164,57,14,36,851,168,885,253,518,352,127,250],"egg":[246,453,335,68,260],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me2pt5-42","name":"Croconaw","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"42","artist":"Felicia Chen","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-42/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-42/large"},{"id":"sv5-40","name":"Croconaw","set":"Temporal Forces","date":"2024-03-22","rarity":"Common","number":"40","artist":"Jerky","img":"sv5/40"},{"id":"swsh8-56","name":"Croconaw","set":"Fusion Strike","date":"2021-11-12","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"56","artist":"Tomokazu Komiya","img":"swsh8/56"},{"id":"sm75-23","name":"Croconaw","set":"Dragon Majesty","date":"2018-09-07","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"23","artist":"Ken Sugimori","img":"sm75/23"},{"id":"sm35-19","name":"Croconaw","set":"Shining Legends","date":"2017-10-06","rarity":"Common","number":"19","artist":"Naoki Saito","img":"sm35/19"},{"id":"xy4-16","name":"Croconaw","set":"Phantom Forces","date":"2014-11-05","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"16","artist":"Sumiyoshi Kizuki","img":"xy4/16"},{"id":"col1-41","name":"Croconaw","set":"Call of Legends","date":"2011-02-09","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"41","artist":"kawayoo","img":"col1/41"},{"id":"hgss1-38","name":"Croconaw","set":"HeartGold & SoulSilver","date":"2010-02-10","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"38","artist":"kawayoo","img":"hgss1/38"},{"id":"dp2-44","name":"Croconaw","set":"Mysterious Treasures","date":"2007-08-01","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"44","artist":"Mitsuhiro Arita","img":"dp2/44"},{"id":"ex15-27","name":"Croconaw δ","set":"Dragon Frontiers","date":"2006-11-01","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"27","artist":"Yuka Morii","img":"ex15/27"},{"id":"ex10-38","name":"Croconaw","set":"Unseen Forces","date":"2005-08-01","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"38","artist":"Masakazu Fukuda","img":"ex10/38"},{"id":"ecard1-74","name":"Croconaw","set":"Exp